  "title": "Kennametal Announces Board Leadership Transition",
  "summary": "Joseph Alvarado Appointed Incoming Chairman; William Lambert to Retire in October PITTSBURGH, July 28, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Kennametal Inc. (NYSE: KMT) today announced that its Board of Directors has appointed Joseph Alvarado as incoming Chairman of the Board, effective October 28, 2026.",
